<title>USA: Scotts Co names Jean Mordo as CFO.</title>
<headline>Scotts Co names Jean Mordo as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotts Co said it named Jean (John) Mordo as chief financial officer to replace Paul Yeager, who will retire at the end of the year.</p>
<p>Mordo, 51, was formerly chief financial officer of United Technologies' Pratt &amp; Whitney unit, Scotts said.</p>
<p>Prior to that he was CFO of Otis Elevator, also a unit of United Technologies.</p>
</text>
